solakon-monitor (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Modbus-TCP monitor for Solakon ONE hybrid solar inverters.
  * Real-time voltage, current, power monitoring.
  * Battery status (SoC, voltage, temperature) via BMS.
  * Energy statistics (PV, charge, discharge, consumption).

